| `abp-authorization` | `skills/abp-authorization/SKILL.md` | Permissions, `[Authorize]`, policies, `ICurrentUser` |
| `abp-infrastructure` | `skills/abp-infrastructure/SKILL.md` | Settings, **features**, caching, local/distributed event bus, background jobs |
| `abp-multitenancy` | `skills/abp-multitenancy/SKILL.md` | `IMultiTenant`, `CurrentTenant`, tenant resolution, data filters |
| `abp-angular` | `skills/abp-angular/SKILL.md` | Angular UI, proxies, `ListService`, `ConfigStateService`, feature-gated routes |
| `abp-cli` | `skills/abp-cli/SKILL.md` | `abp generate-proxy`, `install-libs`, Suite, module commands |

